Package: deb-progress-installer
Version: 1.0.7
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: matt <carber.maxpower@gmail.com>
Depends: zenity, bash, apt
Description: Zenity-based graphical frontend for local DEB packages
 A lightweight graphical utility that wraps around apt and dpkg to provide
 a clear, real-time visual progress bar during the installation, 
 reinstallation, or removal of local Debian (.deb) files.
 .
 The application intercepts the native system status file descriptors to
 translate raw administrative terminal output into a smooth progress track,
 offering terminal-free management for desktop users.
